    <item>
      <title>AI基础设施公司Cornelis筹集20500万美元，目标削弱Nvidia主导地位</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/aichip/post/20260915/AI%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8Cornelis%E7%AD%B9%E9%9B%8620500%E4%B8%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%89%8A%E5%BC%B1Nvidia%E4%B8%BB%E5%AF%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/aichip/post/20260915/AI%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8Cornelis%E7%AD%B9%E9%9B%8620500%E4%B8%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%89%8A%E5%BC%B1Nvidia%E4%B8%BB%E5%AF%BC%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D/</guid>
      <description>融资消息引发AI芯片领域关注 AI基础设施公司Cornelis完成2.05亿美元融资，这一规模显示出投资者对挑战现有市场格局的兴趣。该公司明确将目标指向削弱Nvidia的主导地位，试图在AI计算硬件和基础设施领域打开突破口。 根据公开信息，这次融资为Cornelis提供了进一步开发产</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>d-Matrix 采用 Nvidia NVLink Fusion 与 MGX 机架设计</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/aichip/post/20260910/d-Matrix-%E9%87%87%E7%94%A8-Nvidia-NVLink-Fusion-%E4%B8%8E-MGX-%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%B6%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/</link>
